[0-0]   settingsContent: 'General\n' +
[0-0]     'English\n' +
[0-0]     'Language\n' +
[0-0]     'Choose the display language used by the application UI.\n' +
[0-0]     'English\n' +
[0-0]     'Interface mode\n' +
[0-0]     'Office mode focuses on summaries and results. Coding mode shows commands, output, and code changes.\n' +
[0-0]     'Coding mode\n' +
[0-0]     'Proactive task suggestions\n' +
[0-0]     'Available only in Office mode.\n' +
[0-0]     'Auto-archive old sessions\n' +
[0-0]     'While the app is running, scan recent projects, saved local workspaces, and conversations every 30 minutes; remote workspaces are scanned only while connected. Completed, unread-free, unpinned tasks past the retention window are archived. Enabling this option or changing the retention window also starts a scan.\n' +
[0-0]     'Archive retention\n' +
[0-0]     'A session becomes eligible for auto-archive only after its last update is older than this window.\n' +
[0-0]     'Archive after 7 days\n' +
[0-0]     'Inherit system terminal profile\n' +
[0-0]     'When launching the built-in terminal, inherit login shell environment, proxy, Kubernetes variables, and local terminal font when possible.\n' +
[0-0]     'Terminal font\n' +
[0-0]     'Leave blank to auto-detect system terminal settings; set a value to override the ZCodium terminal font.\n' +
[0-0]     'Save\n' +
[0-0]     'Integrated terminal shell\n' +
[0-0]     'Applies to new sessions only. On Windows, Bash uses this shell; Auto tries Git Bash, then cmd.exe.\n' +
[0-0]     'Auto\n' +
[0-0]     'Tool search\n' +
[0-0]     'Experimental\n' +
[0-0]     'Experimental and off by default. Load tools on demand; token savings are not guaranteed, and tool approvals are unchanged.\n' +
[0-0]     'Off\n' +
[0-0]     'Enhanced Find and Grep\n' +
[0-0]     'Use enhanced Find and Grep in new sessions and sessions restored after an app restart. Active sessions keep their current setting; Find remains unchanged on Windows.\n' +
[0-0]     'HTTP Proxy\n' +
[0-0]     'Route model, MCP, command-tool, and app renderer egress traffic through this proxy; system environment variables are not read. Leave blank and that traffic connects directly, while the embedded browser follows your system proxy settings. Restart the app to take effect.\n' +
[0-0]     'Save\n' +
[0-0]     'No proxy\n' +
[0-0]     'Requests matching these hosts connect directly instead of using the HTTP proxy. Separate rules with commas. Restart the app to take effect.\n' +
[0-0]     'Save\n' +
[0-0]     'Custom certificate\n' +
[0-0]     'Optional. Set a PEM root certificate path to inject it as NODE_EXTRA_CA_CERTS for models, MCP, and command tools, and to trust it in renderer certificate verification. Restart the app to take effect.\n' +
[0-0]     'Save\n' +
[0-0]     'Chrome hardware acceleration\n' +
[0-0]     'Turn this off to work around blank windows, crashes, or rendering issues caused by some GPUs or drivers. Restart the app to take effect.\n' +
[0-0]     'Task notifications\n' +
[0-0]     'Send desktop notifications when a task completes, fails, or needs approval.\n' +
[0-0]     'Notification sound\n' +
[0-0]     'When notifications are enabled, you can mute the task notification sound separately.\n' +
[0-0]     'Hide to tray when closing window\n' +
[0-0]     'The close button and close-window shortcut hide the window, while Quit from the tray still exits the app. On by default on Windows; on Linux it depends on whether the desktop environment provides a system tray.\n' +
[0-0]     'Keep computer running\n' +
[0-0]     'Prevent the system from sleeping due to idle. You can still sleep manually or by closing the lid. Desktop only.\n' +
[0-0]     'Interaction behavior\n' +
[0-0]     'While ZCodium is running, add follow-up actions to the queue or guide them to run after the next tool call.\n' +
[0-0]     'Queue\n' +
[0-0]     'Automatically continue questions\n' +
[0-0]     'When enabled, Agent questions automatically continue after 5 minutes without an answer. When disabled, current and future questions wait for your response.\n' +
[0-0]     'Dynamic workflows\n' +
[0-0]     'Let the model orchestrate many subagents working in parallel, so it can take on complex tasks and deliver polished results.\n' +
[0-0]     'Off\n' +
[0-0]     'Show reasoning\n' +
[0-0]     'Show full reasoning inside the message stream. When off, the first reasoning item in each turn remains visible.\n' +
[0-0]     'Show todos\n' +
[0-0]     'Show Todo tool cards inside the message stream.\n' +
[0-0]     'Group exploration tools\n' +
[0-0]     'Group consecutive reads and searches into an Explore section.\n' +
[0-0]     'Group terminal commands\n' +
[0-0]     'Group consecutive non-read-only shell commands into a Terminal section.\n' +
[0-0]     'Group file changes\n' +
[0-0]     'Group consecutive Write, Edit, and ApplyPatch calls into a Changes section.\n' +
[0-0]     'Data storage path\n' +
[0-0]     'Root directory for app data (defaults to user home directory). Existing data will be copied to the new location. The .zcodium/v2 suffix cannot be changed.\n' +
[0-0]     'Choose folder\n' +
[0-0]     'Save\n' +
[0-0]     'Onboard\n' +
[0-0]     'Choose your role, interface mode, and preferences again. Use Migration settings to import data.\n' +
[0-0]     'Open onboarding',
[0-0]   themeClasses: [ 'dark', 'theme-zai-dark', 'platform-windows-desktop' ],
